OL,1,W5j 5Q5 7575747575x0w1w1 w17571
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAConservatives pledge support for
OL,4,AHeathrow third runway
OL,5,
OL,6,FGriffith said: "The next Conservative
OL,7,Fgovernment will do whatever it takes to
OL,8,Fend the delays and boost capacity by
OL,9,Fbacking the third runway. We are all in
OL,10,Ffor growth and will legislate to sweep
OL,11,Faway the blockers."
OL,13,FPreviously, Prime Minister Andy Burnham
OL,14,Frefused to say whether he backed a
OL,15,Fthird runway, after it emerged the
OL,16,Fproject could be delayed up to four
OL,17,Fyears.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
